{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/a2f644289619cfa4c716f2faf7fb0311.avif?t=1769955839\" width=600 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know what is better than robbing banks? Robbing banks with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to 3 friends to join you in your criminal endeavor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/8fac5021062f659ea2b079cf86717f91.avif?t=1769955839\" width=600 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robbing the same bank over and over again gets boring at some point. That's why many features like position of cameras, guards and objectives will be randomized for each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means every heist will feel a little different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/a46387dea472722cc286a19c6bb6ccf7.avif?t=1769955839\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes not everything goes to plan - if you (or one of your accomplices) triggers the alarm you have to bail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the cops arrive it's over. No shooting your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/218a55fe405700e2f7588f25b5103d8d.avif?t=1769955839\" width=600 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No real guard would patrol the whole night between point A and point B and point C...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guards will get hungry, thristy or go to the toilet. And you can use that to your advantage!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Small Thug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/545f4443175fbef91d6e1e628d2f4f3e6643d27b.jpg"},{"name":"Professional criminal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/2ea956b15a2b9d226e4290bc19d891d17ba3475c.jpg"},{"name":"Criminal Mastermind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/03c7062f3f8ab6d1b2930cc232c0f1f8c5374bbc.jpg"},{"name":"So it begins...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/3cfe0c07dcc1bfc170c923c26690e0f588ff43ef.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the hang","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/ee2c045ef4b431e0b85a239cb4475702eb2b3a18.jpg"},{"name":"Lockpick Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/e6acdb735ebfc2e72b3ccd7cc6cc54327db55d69.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Hacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/357b07c3556075b63855d3f07b95ce57d5fa303b.jpg"},{"name":"Root Admin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/aca48c62fb011dfd45270cd4ebd2434ba2504d66.jpg"},{"name":"True Hackerman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/711aa83036ba62e269b0918ea0ecd0fc4029944c.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/414939cf4d21beb0626e1febeab44d5d0039689f.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382820?t=1769955839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769955839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/